{
  "declaredLength": 9572,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "You there, young Trainer. Could I ask a special\nfavor of you?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075002000740068006500720065002C00200079006F0075006E006700200054007200610069006E00650072002E00200043006F0075006C006400200049002000610073006B002000610020007300700065006300690061006C000A006600610076006F00720020006F006600200079006F0075003F00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’d like you to deliver this letter to the director of\nAcadémie Étoile.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I would do it myself, but I’m afraid that certain\ncircumstances prevent me from doing so.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please. Won’t you deliver it in my stead?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006C0065006100730065002E00200057006F006E2019007400200079006F0075002000640065006C006900760065007200200069007400200069006E0020006D0079002000730074006500610064003F00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Of course I will",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006600200063006F007500720073006500200049002000770069006C006C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This seems...fishy",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006900730020007300650065006D0073002E002E002E006600690073006800790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you doubt my intentions, I suggest you deliver\nthe letter. Then you will see the truth of the whole<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nmatter for yourself.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 131
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci! I knew you had a trustworthy face.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00650072006300690021002000490020006B006E0065007700200079006F00750020006800610064002000610020007400720075007300740077006F007200740068007900200066006100630065002E00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This is the letter that must be delivered.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680069007300200069007300200074006800650020006C00650074007400650072002000740068006100740020006D007500730074002000620065002000640065006C006900760065007200650064002E00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Remember, you must give it to the director of\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Académie Étoile<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>. No one else!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, I remember you...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou helped me find my ring before, didn’t you?\nI did so appreciate your help then.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 112
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And what new good deed has brought you to\nAcadémie Étoile today?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E0064002000770068006100740020006E0065007700200067006F006F0064002000640065006500640020006800610073002000620072006F007500670068007400200079006F007500200074006F000A004100630061006400E9006D00690065002000C90074006F0069006C006500200074006F006400610079003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m looking for the director",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D0020006C006F006F006B0069006E006700200066006F007200200074006800650020006400690072006500630074006F00720000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve come with a letter",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004920190076006500200063006F006D006500200077006900740068002000610020006C006500740074006500720000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A letter...for the director? Well, you’ve found her.\nI am the director of this school.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You gave the Important Letter to Moire!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500200067006100760065002000740068006500200049006D0070006F007200740061006E00740020004C0065007400740065007200200074006F0020004D006F00690072006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Where...where did you get this letter?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570068006500720065002E002E002E00770068006500720065002000640069006400200079006F00750020006700650074002000740068006900730020006C00650074007400650072003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, never mind that—there is an even more\nurgent question that must be answered.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please. Won’t you come to Vert Sector 6 with me?\nI must visit <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Racine Construction<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> at once.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, thank you for coming.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C0020007400680061006E006B00200079006F007500200066006F007200200063006F006D0069006E0067002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you for coming. I feel so much better\nhaving you here with me for support.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I probably should have done this alone, but that\nletter you gave me... It raised so many questions.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI suppose I ought to tell you what it said.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 151
    },
    {
      "displayText": "“I’m so sorry. I left you behind without ever having\nthe chance to tell you something.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n“Fourteen years ago, I entrusted my precious ring\nto a certain man for repairs.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n“The man’s name was Tarragon—the owner of a\nshop called Racine Construction.”<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 255
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Receiving a letter from my deceased husband...\nIt’s simply impossible, isn’t it?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI was afraid to come by myself to find out if what\nthis letter says is true or not.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 172
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Are you...Mr. Tarragon?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410072006500200079006F0075002E002E002E004D0072002E0020005400610072007200610067006F006E003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That I am. How can I help ya?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006100740020004900200061006D002E00200048006F0077002000630061006E00200049002000680065006C0070002000790061003F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tell me...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nDo you remember a man coming to you 14 years\nago, asking for your help repairing a ring?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That I do!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006100740020004900200064006F002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’d gone and taken my little Canari to a fancy\nrestaurant to celebrate her birthday.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We hit it right off with the guy sittin’ next to us.\nCanari took to him like a Ducklett to water.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "When he heard what a dab hand I was at fixin’\nthings, he asked if I could help with settin’ a<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nstone that’d come loose from a ring of his.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 5128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 145
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Told me it was a special ring—one of a pair he\nand his wife had exchanged.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That man was my husband. But I’m afraid there\nwas an accident, and he...he...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m so sorry to hear that, ma’am.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D00200073006F00200073006F00720072007900200074006F0020006800650061007200200074006800610074002C0020006D006120190061006D002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But what a stroke of luck that somethin’ pointed\nyou here after all these long years.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’d hoped perhaps...that ring...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAh, and I’m sure I owe you something for your\nlabor.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 6000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There ain’t no need for that, ma’am.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 6188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006500720065002000610069006E201900740020006E006F0020006E00650065006400200066006F007200200074006800610074002C0020006D006120190061006D002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>\nI can’t take this kind lady’s money.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBut maybe...I could take a battle with young\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> instead. How ’bout it,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nkid?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 13,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 6272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 130
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll be waitin’ in the garage, if yer up for it!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 6532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C002000620065002000770061006900740069006E201900200069006E00200074006800650020006700610072006100670065002C002000690066002000790065007200200075007000200066006F0072002000690074002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Oh please, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, won’t you\ngive<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthe<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ngentleman<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nhis<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nbattle?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nI<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncan’t<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nstand<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nleaving<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthis<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndebt<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nunpaid.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 30,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 6640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 139
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿*",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 6920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That stick-in-the-mud Grisham’s been teachin’ me\nmore than just bakin’!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWe’ve been battlin’ plenty, too. I’ll show ya some\nof the tricks I’ve picked up!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 160
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll still win!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 7252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C0020007300740069006C006C002000770069006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hold on...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 7284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F006C00640020006F006E002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Look, I can’t give that nice lady her ring back\nunless ya pay for it—with a worthy battle!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 7308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s get this Pokémon battle goin’!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 7500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500742019007300200067006500740020007400680069007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200062006100740074006C006500200067006F0069006E2019002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 7584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Come on, Excadrill! Time to show this kid what\nyer drill can do!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 7596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006D00650020006F006E002C00200045007800630061006400720069006C006C0021002000540069006D006500200074006F002000730068006F0077002000740068006900730020006B0069006400200077006800610074000A0079006500720020006400720069006C006C002000630061006E00200064006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿2",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 7728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00320000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ha! Ain’t that just typical. But admit it—me and\nExcadrill gave you a run for yer money, eh?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWe all owe ya big-time, kid. Growin’ stronger to\nput up a real challenge in battle’s just my small<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nway of showin’ ya my appreciation.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 7740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 237
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, consider me paid in full, ma’am. I think it’s\nhigh time this ring made its way back home.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 8216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 8416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002E002E002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You handed over the Cherished Ring!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 8440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075002000680061006E0064006500640020006F00760065007200200074006800650020004300680065007200690073006800650064002000520069006E006700210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I was so distraught when I lost my husband and\nwe never found his ring...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBut now our two rings are back together at last.\nI’ll treasure them and all my memories of him.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 8512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 177
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Goodness—you’ve found both my own lost ring\nand my husband’s ring!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou truly are a wonder, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 8868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gotta admit it’s a weight off my shoulders too,\nhavin’ that ring back where it belongs!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 9076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 9260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I had a wonderful dream the other night.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI was having the most delightful time talking with\nmy darling, back in the days when we first met...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
